    <code code="51848-0" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Evaluation note"/>
    <title>Assessment</title>
    <text><list><item>Personal history of psychological trauma: violence, hunger and cold, and separation from his mother in childhood and youth, and assaults in adulthood, as he describes them; occasional nightmares and watchfulness: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Post-traumatic osteoarthritis of the right hand at the fourth and fifth metacarpophalangeal joints, after metacarpal fractures that healed out of alignment; pain and stiffness with writing: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Insufficient sleep: about five hours on working nights, from late writing and travel for speaking: active, confirmed [S]</item></list></text>

  </section>
